OL,3,GNEWSAUnease over move of rape victims'
OL,4,Aforensic centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA centre that carries out forensic
OL,7,Fmedical examinations on victims of
OL,8,Fsexual assault is being relocated from
OL,9,FPlymouth to St Austell despite
OL,10,Fcampaigning from local councillors and
OL,11,FMPs.
OL,13,FPlymouth councillor Pauline Murphy
OL,14,Fdescribed the decision to move the
OL,15,FSexual Assault Referral Centre (SARC)
OL,16,Ffor Devon and Cornwall as "going under
OL,17,Fthe radar".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1792167997
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAUnease over move of rape victims'
OL,4,Aforensic centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlymouth City Council Plymouth and
OL,7,FSutton MP Luke Pollard opposed the
OL,8,FPlymouth centre closure over concerns
OL,9,Fthat longer journeys would increase
OL,10,Fdistress, delay care and discourage
OL,11,Fincident reporting.
OL,13,FCouncil leader Tudor Evans had asked
OL,14,FNHS England and the police and crime
OL,15,Fcommissioner, which jointly fund the
OL,16,FSARC, to keep forensic capacity in the
OL,17,Fcity.
